WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.487
Puss patted his belly.

2
00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:09.241
Suddenly two servants ran into the room.

3
00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:13.003
"You got rid of the ogre!" one said.

4
00:00:13.004 --> 00:00:17.009
"You are our hero!" the other said.

5
00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.301
Puss waved a paw.

6
00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:21.999
"It was nothing."

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.992
He walked out of the room.

8
00:00:25.993 --> 00:00:30.606
The servants followed him.

9
00:00:30.607 --> 00:00:34.793
Other servants peeked out from doorways.

10
00:00:34.794 --> 00:00:38.459
"Is the ogre really gone?" one asked.

11
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.039
"Are we safe now?"

12
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:48.438
"Yes," Puss said. "You are all safe."

13
00:00:48.439 --> 00:00:52.478
A young girl stepped forward.

14
00:00:52.479 --> 00:00:57.740
"Sir." She wiped away a tear.

15
00:00:57.741 --> 00:01:01.164
"My parents work here.

16
00:01:01.165 --> 00:01:13.886
But the ogre put them in the dungeon."

17
00:01:13.887 --> 00:01:20.644
Puss went down to the dungeon.

18
00:01:20.645 --> 00:01:25.237
It was filled with prisoners.

19
00:01:25.238 --> 00:01:35.666
He set everyone free.

20
00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:39.474
Everyone cheered for Puss.

21
00:01:39.475 --> 00:01:43.552
"How can we ever repay you?" a servant asked.

22
00:01:43.553 --> 00:01:47.029
"The king will be here soon," Puss said.

23
00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:49.881
"He will ask who owns this castle.

24
00:01:49.882 --> 00:01:53.840
Tell him the Duke of Carabas owns it."

25
00:01:53.841 --> 00:01:58.373
"We will!" the servants said.

26
00:01:58.374 --> 00:02:04.054
"Perfect," Puss said.

27
00:02:04.055 --> 00:02:08.114
He looked at a couple of servants.

28
00:02:08.115 --> 00:02:14.179
"Comb your hair and tuck in your shirts!"

29
00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:18.786
Soon the carriage rolled up to the castle.

30
00:02:18.787 --> 00:02:23.424
"This is a fine-looking home," the king said.

31
00:02:23.425 --> 00:02:26.588
"I wonder who owns it."

32
00:02:26.589 --> 00:02:33.166
Just then Fiona's eyes went wide. "It's Puss!"

33
00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:36.736
"Huh?" Carabas looked over.

34
00:02:36.737 --> 00:02:40.257
Puss stood in front of the castle.

35
00:02:40.258 --> 00:02:47.656
He waved. "Welcome home, Master!"

